ut I thought I'd mention it nonetheless. Maybe we should show a temporary \"Loading...\" item while the project is still loading, as a section without any items looks odd.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118079#pullrequestreview-4047659884","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118079","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-04-01T23:51:52Z"},{"id":4048000684,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7xR5as","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","login":"stuartcarnie","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie"},"body":"I have tested on a MacBook Pro M4 Max on Tahoe 26.4 and confirm it works as expected.\n\n| Built-in Display (HDR) | External Display (no HDR) |\n| :----: | :----: |\n| <img width=\"2676\" height=\"1270\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7524ee25-2175-46fb-aa4c-add3e63fd2ce\" /> | <img width=\"2712\" height=\"1230\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8029e91-a9c3-4132-956c-1664dc29d9de\" /> |","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118079#pullrequestreview-4048000684","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118079","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-04-02T02:26:09Z"},{"id":4050315670,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7xaumW","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"n